:name: Apogee-FC
:description: This script runs the Apogee-FC flight firmware on STM32F4 Discovery.

using sysbus
mach create "Apogee-FC"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/stm32f4_discovery-kit.repl

$bin?=@build/flight/zephyr/zephyr.elf

showAnalyzer sysbus.usart2

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""

runMacro $reset
start
